OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786906081
OL,3,CUK groundwater levels in 'remarkable'
OL,4,Chealth despite drought, scientists find
OL,6,FThe UK's groundwater levels are in
OL,7,F"remarkable" health despite this
OL,8,Fsummer's prolonged dry weather and
OL,9,Fwidespread drought conditions,
OL,10,Faccording to scientists.
OL,12,FGroundwater flows through tiny cracks
OL,13,Fin layers of rock and sand
OL,14,Funderground, known as aquifers, which
OL,15,Ffeed into streams and rivers, helping
OL,16,Fto maintain water levels, ecosystems
OL,17,Fand provide around a third of the
OL,18,Fcountry's public water supply.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
